Z||000009||Cooter||12-28-1999||06:46 PM||||I would say that the rims on the red grand am are a close enough match that with a little chrome plating they could pass for Fiero prototype wheels also. This is nothing new to General Motors- the Monte Carlo SS with the alloy wheels had the same wheels as the 81 Z-28. I'm sure they saved a few bucks using the doomed fiero wheel since the molds were already made.||||reg||1
