Z||000017||Steven||12-29-1999||03:56 PM||||They are wheels. They came on the Pontiac N car which is a Grand Am with the option QB4. GM sells them under the part numbers 22548159 1st design which are stamp "MP" or 2nd design 12355257 stamp "LBM". This info was found in the GM parts catalog for 92 Pontiac N Car catalog group 5.803 or a picture can be seen in group 5 illustrations.||||reg||1
